# Phonetix Theory

Vowel

|stroke|function|
|------|--------|
|`A`|`æ`|
|`O`|`ɒ`|
|`U`|`ʌ`|
|`I`|`ɪ`|
|`AO`|`ɛ`|
|`UI`|`ʊ`|
|`AUI`|`y`|
|`AI`|`aɪ`|
|`OI`|`ɔɪ`|
|`AOI`|`eɪ`|
|`AOUI`|`ɪː`|
|`OUI`|`ɒː`|
|`AOU`|`uː juː`|
|`AU`|`aʊ`|
|`OU`|`oʊ`|

Special consonant

|stroke|function|
|------|--------|
|`-FS`|`ss`|
|`-SZ`|`st`|
|`-BGSZ`|`xt`|
|`-PG`|`nk`|
|`-LGTS`|`lt`|

Commands

|stroke|function|
|---|-----------|
|`#`|`repeat_last_translation`|
|`#E`|`MEJIRO_IME:off` (IME off)|
|`#U`|`SWITCH_SYSTEM:Mejiro` then `MEJIRO_IME:on` (IME on)|
|`*R`|`BackSpace`|
|`*F`|`Delete`|
|`P-P/P-P` or `P*P`|`Space`|
|`WR-RB`|`Tab`|
|`R-R`|`Return`|
|`R*R`|`Return`(Capitalize next word)|
|`PR-RP`|`""`|
|`PR*RP`|`"(Capitalized)"`|
|`TP-PL`|`.`|
|`KW-BG`|`,`|
|`KW-PL`|`?`|
|`TP-BG`|`!`|
|`TP*PL`|`.`(Capitalize next word)|
|`KW*BG`|`,`(Capitalize next word)|
|`KW*PL`|`?`(Capitalize next word)|
|`TP*BG`|`!`(Capitalize next word)|
|`H-F`|`-`|
|`H*F`|`_`|
|`PH-FP`|`Delete a space between before two words`|
|`PH*FP`|`Delete a space between before two words`(Don't set space next)|
|`P-P`|`Don't set space next`|
|`KPO`|`Capitalize a word from earlier`|
|`KPO*`|`Capitalize a word from earlier and next word`|
|`KPA`|`Capitalize next word`|
|`KPA*`|`Capitalize next word and dot't set space at next`|
|`KPAO`|`CapsLock next word`|
|`KPAO*`|`Capitalize a word from earlier`|
|`KPAO/KPAO`|`MODE:CAPS`|
`PHRUP`|`PLOVER:LOOKUP`|

IME commands use the Mejiro plugin: Hangul/Hangul_Hanja on Linux, VK_HANGUL/VK_HANJA on Windows, and Kana/Eisu on macOS. Install Mejiro before using these commands.
